the disease</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>1999</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>3866</fpage><lpage>3869</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||59|3866||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10463571</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dumon</surname><given-names>KR</given-names></name><name><surname>Ishii</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Vecchione</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Trapasso</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Baldassarre</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Chakrani</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Druck</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosato</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>NN</given-names></name><name><surname>Baffa</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>During</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Huebner</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Croce</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fragile histidine triad expression delays tumor development and induces apoptosis in human pancreatic cancer</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>2001</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>4827</fpage><lpage>4836</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||61|4827||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11406559</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Elston</surname><given-names>CW</given-names></name><name><surname>Sloane</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Amendoeira</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Apostolikas</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Bellocq</surname><given-names>JP</gi